ce, my skills, how I was a good fit – and I didn’t even write it. The app did that for me. It was kind of magical.” Kaitlyn — University Student Read full article Video Job Application & Interviewing The 8-sec First Impression News Job Search & Prep Jul 18, 2025 5 Reasons you’re not landing the job and what experts say you should do instead Read full article Video Job Search & Prep The Perfect Resume Trap Article Job Search & Prep Jan 13, 2025 What is the hidden job market? Read full article Video Job Search & Prep Never Mind the Gap Article Job Search & Prep Jan 13, 2025 What is career cushioning? Read full article Video Employee Experience The AI Paradox at Work Article Employee Experience Jan 13, 2025 Top employee benefits in 2025 Read full article Article Job Application & Interviewing Jan 13, 2025 The history of the cover letter (and its future) Discover the origin and evolution of the cover letter, from Da Vinci. Read full article Article Job Search & Prep Jan 13, 2025 How to Write a Cover Letter for Jobs in Australia (2025 Guide) Learn how to write a standout cover letter. With tips, examples, and. Read full article Article Job Application & Interviewing Jan 13, 2025 10 common mistakes job seekers make in Australia Job hunting in Australia? Discover the 10 most common job seeker mistakes. Read full article Article Job Application & Interviewing Jan 13, 2025 6 ways to navigate salary expectations questions Master salary expectation discussions with these expert-backed strategies tailored for Australian job. Read full article No results found Try removing a filter or adjusting your search to see more results. Clear filters Frequently Asked Questions Everything you need to know about cutting edge hiring software Can I search for jobs Australia wide? Absolutely. Employment Hero’s job board connects you with opportunities in every state and territory, from major cities to regional and remote communities. Whether you’re looking for a role in Sydney, Melbourne, Brisbane, Perth, Adelaide, Hobart, Darwin, or anywhere in between, you’ll find it here. Can I save jobs for later? Yes! When you find a role that interests you but you’re not quite ready to apply, you can simply save it for later. This allows you to revisit it at any time, without needing to search again. Saved jobs are stored securely in your account, so you can compare opportunities, review details, and apply when it suits you best. It’s a quick and convenient way to stay organised. What types of jobs are available? Our platform offers a wide variety of opportunities across Australia, covering all industries, sectors, and levels of experience. Whether you’re searching for entry-level roles, skilled trades, professional careers, or senior leadership positions, you’ll find options tailored to your skills and interests. How often are jobs updated? We keep our job listings refreshed in real time, with new opportunities added daily as soon as they’re posted by employers. This means you’ll always see the most current openings available across Australia, without worrying about outdated or expired roles. By checking regularly, you’ll maximise your chances of finding your ideal role. Find your next role with Employment Hero Jobs. Hop to it COMPANY About us Careers News & Media Partners GET IN TOUCH Contact us Request a demo SUPPORT Help Centre System status Release notes PRODUCT Employment OS HR & Compliance Recruitment Agent Payroll & Rostering HeroForce Benefits & Perks Integrations Case Studies Pricing LEARN Blog Events Webinars Factsheets Case Studies Templates Whitepapers Reports Press Releases PICK YOUR REGION Australia New Zealand United Kingdom Canada Singapore Malaysia CONNECT in f 𝕏 ig ▶ STAY IN THE LOOP The latest employment law updates, product news and HR tips — straight to your inbox. * → I agree to receive marketing communications from Employment Hero. I can unsubscribe at any time. By clicking ‘Subscribe’ , you consent to receiving marketing from the Employment