      "description": "Academic Administration Assistant Job at Excelsia University College Skip to content You have been redirected to your preferred market of Australia . Clear preference × You're on our Australia website Change Region United Kingdom Singapore Malaysia New Zealand Canada Canada (Fr) × Work Jobs Find the role Land the role Ask Hero AI Learn Login Work HR & Recruitment Payroll Employee Jobs Jobseeker AU Australia New Zealand United Kingdom Canada Singapore Malaysia Get started Jobseeker Employee Employer Work Jobs Find the role Land the role Learn Login Australia Back Learn Trending Article How to ace AI virtual interviews with Employment Hero’s Recruitment Agent 5 min read Article What is the hidden job market? 9 min read Article What is career cushioning? 7 min read Article Top employee benefits in 2025 6 min read Article The history of the cover letter (and its future) 5 min read Resource Types Webinars & Events Video & Audio Salary Calculator Blogs & Guides CV Templates Interview Prep Career Guides Employee Stories Support Centre All Resources Topics AI Best Practice Workplace Effectiveness Wellbeing at Work Learning & Development Remote Working Hiring & Recruitment Interview Preparation Benchmark Your Salary Job Hunting Tips Making Your Salary Go Further Leadership Excellence Employee Experience Writing a Great CV Networking Career Planning Future of Work Effective 1:1s Mentorship Trending Topics All Topics Get Started Trending Article How to ace AI virtual interviews with Employment Hero’s Recruitment Agent 5 min read Article What is the hidden job market? 9 min read Article What is career cushioning? 7 min read Article Top employee benefits in 2025 6 min read Article The history of the cover letter (and its future) 5 min read Resources Webinars & Events Video & Audio Salary Calculator Blogs & Guides Interview Prep Support Centre All Resources topics AI Best Practice Workplace Effectiveness Wellbeing at Work Learning & Development Remote Working Interview Preparation Benchmark Your Salary Job Hunting Tips Making Your Salary Go Further Productivity & Innovation Writing a Great CV Networking Career Planning Future of Work Mentorship All Topics Australia New Zealand United Kingdom Canada Singapore Malaysia Work HR & Recruitment Payroll Employee Jobs Jobseeker Jobseeker Employee Employer Share Copy link Twitter LinkedIn Facebook Report this job Refer a friend Apply now Jobs Admin & Secretarial Academic Administration Assistant Academic Administration Assistant at Excelsia University College Academic Administration • Pennant Hills, New South Wales 2120 , Australia • Full-time AI Job Summary 2+ years working experience in an administration role. Working experience in a customer service role. Experience with a learning management system, particularly Moodle (strongly preferred). Sign up or log in to analyse my fit Role Type On-site • Permanent • Full-time • Entry Level Description Permanent full-time position, with free onsite parking and close to public transport Work as part of a team to fulfill the day-to-day administration of the Academic Schools Be an integral part of Excelsia’s life-transforming global Christian learning community About the Role Reporting to the Academic Administration Manager, primary responsibilities are to: Provide the academic staff with administrative support Coordinate administrative projects to ensure the smooth operation of the Schools Provide exceptional customer service to staff and students as the first point of contact for the Schools Maintain and update course and student information in Excelsia’s learning management system (Moodle) Support casual academic staffing allocations for the Schools for each study period Compile student academic information and submit reports for academic processes Provide secretarial services to various committees including document preparation and minute taking Serve as a team player and share best practice across student experience, system upkeep, organisation, and planning Selection Criteria Qualifications and Professional Standing: Hold a post-secondary qualification Working experience, 2+ years in an administration role Working experience in a customer service role Essential: Committed Christian, involved in a local congregation Experience in business administration and/customer service Proven organisational skills with the ability to multi-task, prioritise, and meet deadlines Must have acute attention to detail and high level of accuracy Excellent oral and written communication skills Must be able to work independently Must uphold ethical integrity while performing duties of a sensitive nature including calculating student grades, and maintaining confidentiality of personal details Familiarity with Word, Excel, Power Point and Outlook Experience with a learning management system, particularly Moodle is strongly preferred Demonstrated excellent interpersonal skills, ability to work appropriately with students, faculty, and administrators, independently as well as in a busy team environment A commitment to lifelong learning Knowledge of and ability to apply equal opportunity principles and work health and safety principles in the workplace Full Australian Working Rights About Us Excelsia University College was founded in 1983 as Australia’s first Christian arts college and, together with Indiana Wesleyan University, we are part of a global Christian learning community with big plans to take Christian higher education to the next level in Australia and the Asia-Pacific region for undergraduate and postgraduate students. Excelsia Benefits Maximise your “take home” income through our Salary Packaging scheme Enjoy flexible and family friendly policies, providing generous leave and working conditions Experience working in a culturally rich environment, with opportunities to engage in spiritual devotions Upskill with our substantial tuition discount to eligible staff and their immediate families to study Excelsia courses Our employees have access to earned wages, the ability to save before you’re paid, financial education and much more. Learn more about why Excelsia is Great Place to Work ® Certified and why our staff love working at Excelsia here: https://greatplacetowork.com.au/companies/excelsia-college/ How to Apply If you meet the above criteria, you have a great opportunity to join our Christian community. Please provide your application with resume and covering letter addressing the position criteria via this website. If you have any queries regarding the position or application process, please contact us via work@excelsia.edu.au. Excelsia University College is a smoke free campus. Company Overview Excelsia contributes to making a better world through active participation in a life-transforming global Christian learning community. Apply now Share this job Refer a friend Copy link Twitter LinkedIn Facebook Report this job × Your reason Fraudulent or scam job posting Inappropriate or offensive content Misleading job description Duplicate job posting Other 0 / 100 Additional comments (optional) 0 / 500 Your email (optional, for follow-up) Please enter a valid email address. Something went wrong. Please try again. Cancel Report COMPANY About us Careers News & Media Partners GET IN TOUCH Contact us Request a demo SUPPORT Help Centre System status Release notes PRODUCT Employment OS HR & Compliance Recruitment Agent Payroll & Rostering HeroForce Benefits & Perks Integrations Case Studies Pricing LEARN Blog Events Webinars Factsheets Case Studies Templates Whitepapers Reports Press Releases PICK YOUR REGION Australia New Zealand United Kingdom Canada Singapore Malaysia CONNECT in f 𝕏 ig ▶ STAY IN THE LOOP The latest employment law updates, product news and HR tips — straight to your inbox. * → I agree to receive marketing communications from Employment Hero. I can unsubscribe at any time. By clicking ‘Subscribe’ , you consent to receiving marketing from the Employment Hero