of the fastest-growing SaaS unicorns, so let’s see if we could be a match! Search open roles Looking for a job powered by Employment Hero? You’re currently looking at job openings at Employment Hero. Looking for opportunities elsewhere? Visit our official Employment Hero Job Board to access open roles from 350,000+ businesses in our network. Our smart AI quickly matches you to suitable roles, eliminating the manual grunt work from your job hunt. Search Employment Hero Jobs The EH Way. This is how we roll. We’re mission first. Our mission is to make employment easier and more valuable for everyone. Everything we do – what we work on, capital we allocate, where we focus – is driven by our mission. We’re AI first. We wield the most advanced artificial intelligence tools–plural–as our default arsenal to solve problems, sharpen decisions, and turbocharge our mission making it our co-pilot. We are remote first Work from anywhere while staying connected through asynchronous communication, trust and collaboration. We embrace flexibility to attract top talent globally, empowering our team to do their best work. We’re apolitical. We do not take a position on political or social topics, unless it relates to our mission. This allows our diverse team to stay connected and focused on the social impact we’re making through our work. When we say these are our values, we mean it Our values aren’t just words—they guide how we work, make decisions, and support each other every day. We hold ourselves accountable to them, always. We’re high performers. We’re a team of A-players, driven by growth and innovation. Learn and be supported by the best – so you can be your best. We make employment easier and more valuable for everyone. We live by our values. We serve We are one team We are bold and ambitious We invent We Own it We serve We believe in a better future of work. We believe we owe it to society to strive for excellence in everything we do. We’re people focused. We are one team We champion diverse personalities, talents and skills. We believe in sharing our strengths and lifting each other up. We are bold and ambitious We challenge prevailing assumptions and question industry norms. We invent We’re inventors, creating solutions that bring about meaningful change. We celebrate failure as well as success. We Own it We take ownership of delivering our personal best every day. The Future of Work We’re a global bunch, cherishing diverse perspectives that fuel innovation towards our BHAG (Big Hairy Audacious Goal). We encourage each other to work in ways that allow us to bring our best selves to work. Our heroes live across 15+ countries, and counting… Interested? Learn how we hire. Excited about Employment Hero? There’s never been a better time to join us. Apply online. Excited about an opportunity with us? We’d love you to apply. Flex your skills and experience in your CV and we’ll put your application in the right hands. We’ll get in touch. One of our talent acquisition specialists will review your suitability for the role and get back to you soon. A good fit? We want to see the real you. Ask us questions and we’ll do the same. We want to ensure a great fit for both of us – because there are two sides to every great career story. It’s decision time. Either way, you’ll hear from us. If the timing isn’t quite right we’ll keep you on file and notify you of other opportunities when they arise. And if we think you’re a great fit, welcome aboard. Open Roles We embrace diversity and invite people of all backgrounds and identities to work with us COMPANY About us Careers News & Media Partners GET IN TOUCH Contact us Request a demo SUPPORT Help Centre System status Release notes PRODUCT Employment OS HR & Compliance Recruitment Agent Payroll & Rostering HeroForce Benefits & Perks Integrations Case Studies Pricing LEARN Blog Events Webinars Factsheets Case Studies Templates Whitepapers Reports Press Releases PICK YOUR REGION Australia New Zealand United Ki